flowchart TD
    A[Register user] --> USERS[(users)]
    USERS --> B[Create or select project]
    B --> PROJECTS[(projects)]

    PROJECTS --> C[Define inclusive or exclusive scope rules]
    C --> SCOPES[(scope_validations)]

    PROJECTS --> D[Create target]
    D --> TARGETS[(targets)]

    TARGETS --> E[Create scan record]
    E --> SCANS[(scans)]
    SCANS --> F[Update status: PENDING, RUNNING, COMPLETED or FAILED]
    F --> G[Persist parsed findings]
    G --> VULNS[(vulnerabilities)]

    VULNS --> H[Generate and store safe recommendations]
    H --> RECS[(recommendations)]

    SCANS --> I[Aggregate scan, findings and recommendation summaries]
    VULNS --> I
    RECS --> I
    I --> REPORTS[(reports)]

    NOTE[Relationships use cascading foreign keys:<br/>user to project to target to scan to findings]
    NOTE -.-> PROJECTS
